          "text": "# Debug probes\nProbe nodes (Library > Debug) evaluate their input on the GPU at one point and show the numbers.\n- Click the uv tag to move the sample point: uv 0,0 > center > mouse > custom uv.\n- Right-click a probe for its settings: precision, history length, range, beat ticks.\n- NaN and Inf show in red: the usual cause of black pixels.\n- Frame Stats / Histogram scan the whole frame on a coarse 64-wide grid.\n- MCP: read_probes returns every value (plus plot history).\n## In this patch\n- Time, and sin(time) as a plot and an LED\n- u_bass and u_beatPhase (play audio, or pick the metronome)\n- a palette colour sampled at the center\n- a NaN bug that blacks out a disk\n- an XY scope tracing a Lissajous curve",
